#: NAVIGATION.md:1
msgid "Rewriting the coordination for plumed in Cuda"
msgstr "PLUMED の Coordination を CUDA で書き直す"

#: NAVIGATION.md:3
msgid ""
"Here I am showing how to set up a plug-in that is compiled with the cuda "
"compiler and that can be LOADed in plumed. The project consists in two "
"parts: the actual [coordination implementation](Implementation.md) and a "
"[helper module](Helpers.md) with the reduction algorithm and a tool for "
"easing memory management."
msgstr ""
"CUDA Compiler でビルドし、PLUMED に LOAD できる Plugin を作ります。[Coordination "
"の実装](Implementation.md) と、Reduction・Memory 管理用の [Helper](Helpers.md) "
"の2部分からなります。"

